      "routeSummary": "with Alleppey Houseboat",
      "overviewText": "The **Kerala Highlights Tour with Alleppey Houseboat** is a short and well-crafted itinerary for travelers who want to experience the essence of Kerala in limited time. This **5 Days Kerala tour package** focuses on the state’s most popular experiences—hill stations, wildlife, and backwaters—making it ideal for families, couples, and first-time visitors.\n\nThe journey begins in **Kochi**, followed by two relaxing nights in **Munnar**, known for tea plantations, waterfalls, and scenic viewpoints. The trip then moves to **Thekkady**, home to the famous Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary and spice plantations. The highlight of the tour is a peaceful overnight stay on an **Alleppey houseboat**, cruising through Kerala’s iconic backwaters.\n\nWith a **private taxi**, multiple stay categories, and a comfortable travel pace, this Kerala highlights package offers a hassle-free and value-for-money holiday experience.\n\n\n### Places Covered in This Kerala Highlights Tour\n### \n#### **Munnar (2 Nights)**\n#### \nMunnar is Kerala’s most popular hill station, known for its rolling **tea plantations**, misty valleys, waterfalls, and cool climate. During your stay, you’ll explore scenic viewpoints, lush tea gardens, and natural attractions that make Munnar ideal for relaxation and nature lovers. The pleasant weather and green landscapes make it a perfect start to your Kerala journey.\n\n#### **Thekkady (1 Night)**\n#### \nThekkady is home to the famous **Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary**, one of South India’s most well-known forest reserves. This region is known for its spice plantations, dense forests, and rich wildlife. Travelers can enjoy nature walks, optional boating experiences, and a peaceful stay surrounded by greenery.\n\n#### **Alleppey (1 Night – Houseboat)**\n#### \nAlleppey is the heart of Kerala’s **backwaters** and a highlight of this tour. An overnight **houseboat stay** lets you cruise through palm-lined canals, quiet villages, and scenic waterways. All meals are served on board, making it one of the most relaxing and memorable experiences of a Kerala trip.\n\n\n### Why You Should Opt for This Kerala Highlights Package\n### \n- **Perfect Short Kerala Trip:** Covers Kerala’s top highlights in just 5 days\n- **Alleppey Houseboat Stay Included:** A must-do Kerala backwaters experience\n- **Private Tour Experience:** Dedicated taxi with driver for comfort and flexibility\n- **Multiple Hotel Categories:** Choose from Basic, Standard, Premium, or Luxury\n- **Family-Friendly & Relaxed Pace:** Ideal for families and senior travelers\n- **Budget-Friendly Kerala Package:** Starting at ₹20,800 with major inclusions\n\n\n### Important Tips for Kerala Highlights Trip\n### \n- **Best Time to Visit:** October to March for pleasant weather\n- **Pack Light & Breathable Clothes:** Kerala has a warm, humid climate\n- **Carry Comfortable Footwear:** Useful for sightseeing and plantation walks\n- **Book Early in Peak Season:** Especially for premium and luxury stays\n- **Respect Local Customs:** Dress modestly at religious and cultural sites",
