      "routeSummary": "Free Houseboat Stay",
      "overviewText": "The **Experience Kerala Tour Package (8 Days / 7 Nights)** is a thoughtfully designed itinerary for travelers who want to explore Kerala in depth without rushing. This package blends hill stations, wildlife, beaches, backwaters, and heritage cities into one seamless private tour, making it ideal for families and leisure travelers.\n\nThe journey begins in **Kochi**, leading to the misty hills of **Munnar**, followed by a nature-focused stay in **Thekkady**. You then unwind at the beaches of **Kovalam**, explore **Thiruvananthapuram**, enjoy a peaceful **Alleppey houseboat stay**, and conclude with sightseeing in Cochin.\n\nWith **free houseboat stay**, private vehicle transfers, airport pickup and drop, and multiple hotel categories from **Basic to Luxury**, this Kerala tour package offers comfort, flexibility, and excellent value for money.\n\n\n### Places Covered in Experience Kerala Tour Package\n### \n#### **Munnar (2 Nights)**\n#### \nMunnar is one of Kerala’s most visited hill stations, famous for tea plantations, cool climate, waterfalls, and scenic viewpoints. It is ideal for relaxed sightseeing and nature lovers.\n\n#### **Thekkady (1 Night)**\n#### \nThekkady is known for the Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary, spice plantations, and forest landscapes, offering a calm and eco-tourism experience.\n\n#### **Kovalam (2 Nights)**\n#### \nKovalam is a popular beach destination with crescent-shaped beaches, lighthouse views, and a relaxed coastal atmosphere, perfect for leisure and beachside relaxation.\n\n#### **Alleppey (1 Night – Houseboat)**\n#### \nAlleppey is the heart of Kerala’s backwaters. An overnight **houseboat stay** allows you to cruise through canals, villages, and palm-lined waterways with all meals included.\n\n#### **Kochi (1 Night)**\n#### \nKochi offers cultural and historical attractions like Fort Kochi, Chinese fishing nets, colonial architecture, and vibrant local markets.\n\n\n### Why You Should Opt for This Experience Kerala Tour Package\n### \n- **Complete Kerala Itinerary:** Hills, wildlife, beaches, backwaters, and culture in one trip\n- **Free Alleppey Houseboat Stay:** One of Kerala’s most sought-after experiences\n- **Private Tour Comfort:** Dedicated vehicle and driver-cum-guide\n- **Airport Transfers Included:** Hassle-free arrival and departure\n- **Multiple Hotel Categories:** Options from Basic to Luxury\n- **Family-Friendly Pace:** Comfortable travel days with minimal rush\n\n\n### Important Tips for Experience Kerala Trip\n### \n- **Best Time to Visit:** October to March for pleasant weather\n- **Pack Light Cotton Clothing:** Kerala has a warm and humid climate\n- **Carry Beachwear:** Especially for Kovalam\n- **Book Early in Peak Season:** Premium and luxury stays sell out fast\n- **Respect Local Culture:** Dress modestly at temples and heritage sites",
